  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development to which this permission relates must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of the decision notice. \r\rReason: To comply with the provisions of S.51 of the Planning & Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.\r",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the approved plans, as set out in the attached schedule which forms part of this notice. \r\rLocation Plan dated 21.06.2026;\rProposed Site Plan showing garden office and Roof Plan;\rEurocell Sheet GR68554 dated 20.06.2026;\rEurocell Studio Garden Room Plan View dated 20.06.2026;\rEurocell Studio Garden Room Floor Plan dated 20.06.2026;\rEurocell Studio Garden Room Front Elevation dated 20.06.2026;\rEurocell Studio Garden Room Left Elevation dated 20.06.2026;\rEurocell Studio Garden Room Right Elevation dated 20.06.2026;\rEurocell Studio Garden Room Rear Elevation dated 20.06.2026;\rSuDS Pro Forma.\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "All new external work shall be carried out in materials that match the existing building or as specified in the approved application.\r\rReason: To safeguard the appearance of the premises and the character of the immediate area.\r",
    "The outbuilding hereby permitted shall be used only for purposes ancillary to the residential use of the dwellinghouse known as 40B Goring Road, London, N11 2DD.and shall not be used, occupied, sold, let or otherwise disposed of as a separate dwelling or independent residential unit.\r\rReason: To ensure that the outbuilding remains ancillary to the host dwelling and does not form a separate residential unit, in the interests of protecting the character of the area, neighbouring amenity and the proper planning of the site.\r"
  ]
